  "source": "JoyPro curated on the maker's photo (2026-10-11), panel seen from its front-left corner and above: landing-gear lever to the left, guarded T7/T8 at the back, T1-T6 and encoders E1-E3 at the front, B5-B10 block to the right; turned about 90 degrees against Virpil's layout sheet",
