  "confidence": "high",
  "note": "B1 and B3 sit behind the gear-lever housing (only edges visible); T7/T8 are under closed red guards (markers on the covers). Landing lever 41/42/43 per the official sheet (EDCD's older map says 40/41/42, catalog follows the sheet). the sheet stacks each toggle's higher number above its lower one (12 over 11); the catalog calls the lower number \"up\". The sheet does not say which is up; positions are unaffected.",
